{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261021/photo/bkn-20261021074747301-1021_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261021094837\"/><p>意外涉及客貨車及校巴。</p><p>西隧發生交通意外。今晨（21日）7時55分，一輛校巴在九龍沿西區海底隧道往港島方向行駛，期間在快線近入口前，與前方一輛客貨車首尾相撞。事件中無學童受傷，客貨車司機腳部受傷，意外因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T01:59:51.726469+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T23:47:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T02:18:18.844045+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T01:57:49.355936+00:00","content_hash":"821f8eac47f5343806607f597758124361dde132a3d832aa3e11ab7ae0659ee2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}